 pakman show  um i apologize if that's what you were  expecting onward and upward  to more things and expansion and more  announcements coming soon  um i did unfortunately have to mute  hundreds of people  on twitter after these appearances  because of the amount  of just vitriolic trolling  but my new approach is i don't even  think about engaging with the nonsense  on twitter or social media i see it i  mute it  i don't have to think about it again and  i strongly strongly advise  uh other people in the audience to do  the same thing  unfortunately some of the people in the  audience are the ones doing the trolling  and so they probably won't take that  advice but if you're a good faith actor  on social media  i'm telling you i am doing much better  uh in terms of everything productivity  focus  uh concentrating on the right things  over the noise  since i have just started this policy of  no engagement with trolls  mute them don't think about them again  that's that's my advice to you
 

